<%@ page contentType="text/html;charset=UTF-8" %><!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Features | StudentHub</title><script src="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/assets/js/theme.js?v=${applicationScope.assetVersion}"></script><link rel="stylesheet" href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/assets/css/public.css?v=${applicationScope.assetVersion}"><script src="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/assets/js/public.js?v=${applicationScope.assetVersion}" defer></script></head><body class="public-page"><jsp:include page="partials/header.jsp"/><main><section class="page-hero"><div class="public-container"><p class="eyebrow">Built for student life</p><h1>Everything you need.<br><span>Nothing you don't.</span></h1><p>StudentHub keeps academic updates structured, timely and easy to find.</p></div></section>
<section class="showcase"><div class="public-container showcase-row"><div class="showcase-copy"><span class="section-number">01</span><p class="eyebrow">Announcements</p><h2>Updates with clear academic context.</h2><p>Every announcement stays categorized and connected to the students who need it.</p></div><div class="showcase-ui announcement-ui"><div class="pill-row"><span>Assignment</span><span>Tutorial</span><span>Exam</span><span>Event</span><span>General News</span><span>Lecture Material</span></div><article><small>Assignment · Semester 4</small><h3>Database Normalization Exercises</h3><p>Review the attached exercise set before the submission deadline.</p><strong>Due tomorrow · 11:59 PM</strong></article></div></div></section>
<section class="showcase alt"><div class="public-container showcase-row reverse"><div class="showcase-copy"><span class="section-number">02</span><p class="eyebrow">Deadlines</p><h2>Know what is due before it becomes urgent.</h2><p>Deadlines remain integrated with their announcements and appear in a focused schedule.</p></div><div class="showcase-ui timeline-ui"><article><span></span><div><strong>Database Assignment</strong><small>Due tomorrow</small></div></article><article><span></span><div><strong>Linear Algebra Exam</strong><small>3 days left</small></div></article><article><span></span><div><strong>Tutorial 5</strong><small>Friday</small></div></article></div></div></section>
<section class="showcase"><div class="public-container showcase-row"><div class="showcase-copy"><span class="section-number">03</span><p class="eyebrow">Notifications</p><h2>Timely signals, without unnecessary noise.</h2><p>Compact alerts make new academic activity easy to scan.</p></div><div class="showcase-ui notification-ui"><article><span class="mini-mark">A</span><div><strong>New assignment posted</strong><small>2 min ago</small></div></article><article><span class="mini-mark">E</span><div><strong>Exam schedule updated</strong><small>10 min ago</small></div></article></div></div></section>
<section class="showcase alt"><div class="public-container showcase-row reverse"><div class="showcase-copy"><span class="section-number">04</span><p class="eyebrow">Discussions</p><h2>The right room for every academic scope.</h2><p>Move directly to the relevant discussion space without fake feeds or distracting conversations.</p></div><div class="showcase-ui discussion-ui"><div class="pill-row"><span>Section</span><span>Semester</span><span>All Students</span><span>CR — Same Semester</span><span>CR — All</span></div><div class="room-preview"><span class="mini-mark">D</span><div><strong>Discussion Rooms</strong><small>Scope-based academic communication</small></div></div></div></div></section>
<section class="showcase"><div class="public-container showcase-row"><div class="showcase-copy"><span class="section-number">05</span><p class="eyebrow">Academic profile</p><h2>Your academic identity, clearly summarized.</h2><p>Your university, semester and section keep StudentHub relevant to you.</p></div><div class="showcase-ui profile-ui"><div class="initial-avatar">S</div><div><small>Student</small><h3>TNT-2395</h3><p>University of Information Technology</p><div class="pill-row"><span>Semester 4</span><span>Section B</span></div></div></div></div></section>
<section class="final-cta"><div class="public-container"><div><p class="eyebrow">Student life, organized</p><h2>Ready to simplify your academic day?</h2></div><a class="button primary" href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/register">Get Started →</a></div></section></main><jsp:include page="partials/footer.jsp"/></body></html>
